; Repointed from the stylised lowpoly Quaternius tree to the decimated Poly Haven
; photoscan. The salmon-pink trunks and flat cartoon canopies of the original read
; as a different game to everything around them. Scale below normalises the 19.2 m
; scan down to the ~7-9 m street/rural tree the original occupied, and the trunk
; collision is kept at the original dimensions so traversal is unchanged.
